damaged_code:
```java
try {
    someQuery();
} catch (SQLException e) {
    throw new RuntimeException("Database error occurred!"); // Lost the original cause 'e'!
}
```

fix:
Pass the caught exception as the cause parameter to the new exception's constructor.
```java
try {
    someQuery();
} catch (SQLException e) {
    throw new RuntimeException("Database error occurred!", e);
}
```
